MATEIEV FUNCTIONS (p.1)
Equation 20.2.2 can be reduced to one of four simpler types, given in 20.2.3 and 20.2.4 below
20.2.3   y_{n}=\sum_m=0^n  A_{2n+p}cos(2m+p)z, p=0 or1
20.2.4   y_{1}=\sum_m=0^n  B_{2n+p}sin(2m+p)z, p=0 or1
If p=0, the solution is of period p; if p=1, the solution is of period 2p.
